                    "The pattern is not digital up or digital down, which is how this gets reported every quarter.  App and connected-television supply is growing and open-web video and display are shrinking, and the companies that sell the shrinking half are now financially fragile rather than merely slow.  That turns a media question into a counterparty question.  A twelve-month commitment is a bet that the vendor is still there in twelve months, and a company carrying seven times as much debt as cash while declining to forecast its own next quarter is telling you it does not know either.",
